                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 23]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Statement by the United Kingdom Delegation on Article
                        30</hi></head>
                <p>The United Kingdom Delegation wish to place on record their conviction that the
                    Treaty must provide definite machinery for the final settlement of any disputes
                    which may arise.</p>
